RustDesk is a trademark of its respective owners (Purslane Ltd.). rdweb is an
independent browser client that speaks the RustDesk network protocol so it can
connect to RustDesk peers through RustDesk-compatible servers; it is not
affiliated with or endorsed by RustDesk / Purslane Ltd.

proto/*.proto are written for this project. They declare only the messages
rdweb uses, with field numbers and types matching the protocol for
interoperability. No RustDesk source code is included.

src/react/ui/* are adapted from shadcn/ui (MIT, https://ui.shadcn.com).
dist/react/style.css is generated with Tailwind CSS and includes a scoped
subset of its preflight (MIT, Tailwind Labs). The React UI was moved here
from RD Panel (MIT, same authors).

src/react/fonts/nerdSymbols.ts embeds "Symbols Nerd Font" 3.5.1 from
Nerd Fonts (https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts, MIT, Copyright (c) 2014
Ryan L McIntyre), converted to WOFF2. Its icon sets keep their licenses, among
them Font Awesome and Codicons (CC BY 4.0), Material Design Icons (Apache 2.0),
Octicons and Powerline Extra Symbols (MIT), Weather Icons and Pomicons (SIL OFL
1.1); see the Nerd Fonts README for the full list. src/react/xtermCss.ts is the
stylesheet of xterm.js (MIT, The xterm.js authors).

